===== setup: users, groups, binaries, udev
exists:  kv_alice (uid 997)
exists:  kv_bob (uid 996)
exists:  kv_eve (uid 995)
exists:  kv_carol (uid 994)
exists:  group kvault
         kv_alice in kvault
         kv_bob in kvault
         kv_eve in kvault
exists:  group kvaudit
         kv_carol in kvaudit

Roles are not a property of the account: they are bound inside the
vault with `vaultctl set-role <uid> <role>`, or loaded from
configs/policy.conf. Deleting these users does not remove the
bindings, so a useradd/userdel cycle can hand a recycled UID an
inherited role - see docs/06-test-report.md.
